# calibration from https://sentinels.copernicus.eu/documents/247904/4069145/Sentinel-3-MPC-RAL-SLSTR-Cyclic-Report-065-046.pdf
#  noise is given as a function of time/calibration target.  Here worst case up until the end of 2020 is used.

